---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Contact & corrections | Get Cited" description="Report errors in Get Cited with a claim, primary source, and suggested correction through the public project repository.">
  <main id="main-content" class="policy mx-auto max-w-4xl px-5 py-10">
    <header><p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase text-blue-800">Get Cited project</p><h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">Contact &amp; corrections</h1></header>
    <p>The project maintainer is reachable through the <a href="https://github.com/Shubhankar639-bit/genesis-final-prototype">public GitHub repository</a>. For an evidence or accessibility correction, use <a href="https://github.com/Shubhankar639-bit/genesis-final-prototype/issues">GitHub Issues</a>. A GitHub account is required to submit an issue. No response time is promised.</p>
<h2>What to include</h2><ol><li>The page URL and section containing the issue.</li><li>The precise claim or usability problem.</li><li>A working primary-source link and the relevant table, page, or passage.</li><li>A proposed correction and the measurement boundary, if applicable.</li></ol>
<h2>Public feedback</h2><p>Issues are public. Do not include passwords, personal health information, or other sensitive data. We do not operate a private contact form or collect feedback directly on this site. See <a href="/privacy/">privacy information</a> and the <a href="/about/">editorial policy</a>.</p>
    <p><a href="/">Return to the evidence review</a></p>
  </main>
  <footer class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-5 py-8 text-sm text-slate-600">Get Cited project · Updated <time datetime="2026-10-14">14 October 2026</time></footer>
</Layout>
<style>.policy :global(p), .policy :global(ol) { margin-top: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; } .policy :global(h2) { margin-top: 2rem; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; } .policy :global(a) { color: #1e40af; text-decoration: underline; } .policy :global(ol) { list-style: decimal; padding-left: 1.5rem; }</style>
